@startuml ITing_Deployment_Diagram
title Sơ đồ triển khai hệ thống ITing (UML Deployment — gợi ý cho luận văn)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' --- Khối phát triển / CI ---
together {
  actor "Lập trình viên" as Dev
  node "GitHub" as GH <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "Kho mã nguồn\n(ITing)" as Repo
    artifact "GitHub Actions\n(ci.yml, deploy.yml)" as GA
    artifact "GHCR\n(GitHub Container Registry)" as GHCR #LightYellow
  }
}

Dev --> Repo : push / tag v*
GA --> GHCR : build, đẩy image\niting-backend, iting-frontend

' --- AWS Compute ---
node "AWS EC2 (Ubuntu)" <<executionEnvironment>> as EC2 #HoneyDew {
  node "Docker Engine" <<executionEnvironment>> as Docker {
    artifact "nginx-proxy\n(nginx:alpine)" as Nginx
    artifact "iting-frontend\n(React / Vite)" as FE
    artifact "iting-backend\n(Spring Boot)" as BE
    artifact "redis\n(Redis cache)" as Redis
    artifact "certbot\n(Let's Encrypt)" as Cert
  }
}

GHCR ..> Docker : docker compose pull\n(BACKEND_IMAGE, FRONTEND_IMAGE)\nqua SSH (deploy.yml)

actor "Người dùng\n(Web browser)" as User
User --> Nginx : HTTPS :443\n(datnhk252iting.dpdns.org,\napi.*)

Nginx --> FE : proxy\n(static SPA)
Nginx --> BE : proxy\n(API / actuator)

BE --> Redis : Redis protocol\n(cache / session config)

' --- Dịch vụ ngoài EC2 (theo biến môi trường dự án) ---
node "Amazon RDS\nPostgreSQL" <<database>> as RDS #AliceBlue
note right of RDS
  **Căn cứ:** deploy/.env.local.example (DB_HOST = *.rds.amazonaws.com)
  Spring: SPRING_DATASOURCE_*
end note

cloud "Kafka cluster\n(bootstrap ngoài Compose)" as Kafka #WhiteSmoke
note bottom of Kafka
  **Căn cứ:** SPRING_KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS\n=${KAFKA_BROKERS}
  Có thể MSK, cụm EC2, hoặc broker khác —\ncần khớp file **/opt/iting/.env.prod** trên máy chủ.
end note

storage "Amazon S3\n(bucket lưu trữ đối tượng)" as S3 #LightYellow
note right of S3
  **Căn cứ:** AWS_S3_BUCKET,\nAWS_* trong compose
end note

BE --> RDS : JDBC\nPostgreSQL :5432
BE --> Kafka : Producer / Consumer
BE --> S3 : AWS SDK\n(upload file)

Cert .. Nginx : gia hạn chứng chỉ TLS\n(volume letsencrypt)

@enduml
